## Overview
#c1[overview,i5] Logrus provides structured logging via an Entry-based workflow backed by a Logger instance, accessible either through a standard package-level logger or custom-instantiated loggers.
  > doc.go:2 #c15b9a63b369
  > doc.go:4 #a0b77d449162
  > doc.go:13-18 #7acbe495a4bd
